# What docker.lua needs from outside Hammerspoon, declared beside the only file that
# knows this tool exists. Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason.
# See Dependencies.spoon for the kinds and for how these files are found.
# Optional, because a machine with no docker is an ordinary machine. The source reports
# itself unavailable, the merge simply gains no container rows, and every other source
# still lists what it finds.
docker | path | docker | optional | lists running containers and stops one by name
